<title>HONG KONG: Gujing Distillery B shares plunge 8.22 pct.</title>
<headline>Gujing Distillery B shares plunge 8.22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gujing Distillery Co Ltd B shares plunged HK$0.97 or 8.22 pct to HK$10.83 in early afternoon trading on Wednesday after the company announced a poor dividend plan for 1996, brokers said.</p>
